{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/6ad3ffbf0148b58700b7ae5ef48b4f76.poster.avif?t=1771843315\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/6ad3ffbf0148b58700b7ae5ef48b4f76.webm?t=1771843315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/6ad3ffbf0148b58700b7ae5ef48b4f76.mp4?t=1771843315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rule through the chaos! Fifteen years after Avyanna freed Nevendaar from the tyrannical grip of the gods, <strong>Disciples: Domination</strong> returns you to a realm hanging in the balance. In this dark fantasy strategy RPG with turn-based combat, take your place on Queen Avyanna\u2019s throne \u2013 and attempt to hold together a crumbling kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fire of doubt burns scorching within her, sparked by the crushing weight of the throne in Yllian and stoked by twisted dreams of becoming one of the very monsters she once defied \u2013 and destroyed. Paralyzed by fear and haunted by her own power, Avyanna\u2019s rule begins to crack. Allies disappear and abandon her. An unknown force spreads strife and madness through her realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours \u2013 shape the future, for salvation or ruin. As you chase the truths behind the ceaseless conflicts, dark magic and lurking conspiracies infecting your rotting empire, you\u2019ll face betrayal, strife, and shadowy schemes. Uncover the long-lost Mountain Clans, witness the rise of an ancient cult and confront a corrupted seer whose visions have awoken bitter grudges, while old enemies are on the rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will take all your courage to save Nevendaar. Are you brave enough to face \u2013 and embrace \u2013 its darkest truths? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/c06b0752a682e93d32bd1c8e1f9552a8.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/c06b0752a682e93d32bd1c8e1f9552a8.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>In <strong>Disciples: Domination</strong> you continue Avyanna\u2019s journey in a grim tale of power, war and sacrifice. Every decision carves her path \u2013 shaping her fate and the future of Nevendaar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/04f91d3c393f4e26e5d57bfc5625bdae.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/04f91d3c393f4e26e5d57bfc5625bdae.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>From your capital, Yllian, you rule your realm and army. Consult your companions for guidance as your choices shape your faction reputation, impacting how others react to your rule, and the whole world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/12a5eda4d7373d798296a04d40232b18.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/12a5eda4d7373d798296a04d40232b18.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>Lead your army in tactical, grid-based battles with faster pacing, dynamic events and richer interaction. New skills, faction abilities and unit synergies deepen your strategical options along with the unique system of strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/f0c313ea7e36e0fe6ad60627e674ad93.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/f0c313ea7e36e0fe6ad60627e674ad93.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>Unlock and choose trusted companions to reflect your playstyle \u2013 leveraging their combat prowess and unique world skills to aid your quest to save Nevendaar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/d084fd44cd3704099aada8abc90a9953.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/d084fd44cd3704099aada8abc90a9953.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>Recruit and upgrade units from five distinct factions. Build powerful squads by combining unique skills and abilities and train them to defeat your enemies in turn-based encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/bc007e5bef45fddedece6141a1c0cf6d.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/bc007e5bef45fddedece6141a1c0cf6d.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>Travel the dark, living world of Nevendaar in real time. Uncover new regions, meet compelling characters, face terrifying foes, and dive into rewarding quests as the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/09ecf4cb5ef90675811a73171cb347c1.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/09ecf4cb5ef90675811a73171cb347c1.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>The dwarves are back \u2013 and they might not be your allies. Will they stand with you, or spark a new fire you\u2019ll be forced to extinguish?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Return of the Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2808560/d2a1806e58d42aeabce00ebfce5693ef1a8ad7a2.jpg"},{"name":"Wulf Coast Liberator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2808560/72fc1e11051b67bb0a615f6be1cbc88af7b81c5c.jpg"},{"name":"End of a Legacy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2808560/84a2f0342ca29b7fc995315ca5ea5112b743f517.jpg"},{"name":"It\u2019s Hot in Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2808560/eb7fdc797d15a0454c162c7203d7641f98044d96.jpg"},{"name":"United at Last","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2808560/f6c034a41947cee00b5257e06f28a790565bdee1.jpg"},{"name":"Precious One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2808560/77b51ae8868578ef3a8b80603c8fa34c38405a3e.jpg"},{"name":"Mixed Emotions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2808560/34d7f8b21e02e02d505a0078b5ab96e55879f499.jpg"},{"name":"Queen\u2019s Wardrobe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2808560/1b69d07d020080fc90f0d9aadbecfa21ed2405c0.jpg"},{"name":"Side Tracked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2808560/9127daa40c7f0ae6f1ff068fe6f195effa21f067.jpg"},{"name":"Not Easy to be a Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2808560/a0acb807c39e3bba956e4d8e2a79a5919db2581a.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2808560?t=1771843315","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/cde741a2335136c337c3fcf14f6d5eb463215021/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771843315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/8d5e73a17d298c5a408dfa0f622016fe5baaa1ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771843315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/8d5e73a17d298c5a408dfa0f622016fe5baaa1ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771843315","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains content that may not be appropriate for all ages, featuring fantasy violence and combat scenes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Disciples: Domination - Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/c3a360e7773d71ccf72efbdb38851d7b.avif?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/c3a360e7773d71ccf72efbdb38851d7b.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disciples: Domination \u2013 Deluxe Edition </strong>offers you a host of extras for your reign over Nevendaar! In addition to the main game, this package equips you with a huge skin package, a Resource Starter Boost Pack, the Original Soundtrack, and a digital Compendium.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/6ad3ffbf0148b58700b7ae5ef48b4f76.poster.avif?t=1771843315\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/6ad3ffbf0148b58700b7ae5ef48b4f76.webm?t=1771843315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/6ad3ffbf0148b58700b7ae5ef48b4f76.mp4?t=1771843315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rule through the chaos! Fifteen years after Avyanna freed Nevendaar from the tyrannical grip of the gods, <strong>Disciples: Domination</strong> returns you to a realm hanging in the balance. In this dark fantasy strategy RPG with turn-based combat, take your place on Queen Avyanna\u2019s throne \u2013 and attempt to hold together a crumbling kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fire of doubt burns scorching within her, sparked by the crushing weight of the throne in Yllian and stoked by twisted dreams of becoming one of the very monsters she once defied \u2013 and destroyed. Paralyzed by fear and haunted by her own power, Avyanna\u2019s rule begins to crack. Allies disappear and abandon her. An unknown force spreads strife and madness through her realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours \u2013 shape the future, for salvation or ruin. As you chase the truths behind the ceaseless conflicts, dark magic and lurking conspiracies infecting your rotting empire, you\u2019ll face betrayal, strife, and shadowy schemes. Uncover the long-lost Mountain Clans, witness the rise of an ancient cult and confront a corrupted seer whose visions have awoken bitter grudges, while old enemies are on the rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will take all your courage to save Nevendaar. Are you brave enough to face \u2013 and embrace \u2013 its darkest truths? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/c06b0752a682e93d32bd1c8e1f9552a8.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/c06b0752a682e93d32bd1c8e1f9552a8.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>In <strong>Disciples: Domination</strong> you continue Avyanna\u2019s journey in a grim tale of power, war and sacrifice. Every decision carves her path \u2013 shaping her fate and the future of Nevendaar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/04f91d3c393f4e26e5d57bfc5625bdae.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/04f91d3c393f4e26e5d57bfc5625bdae.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>From your capital, Yllian, you rule your realm and army. Consult your companions for guidance as your choices shape your faction reputation, impacting how others react to your rule, and the whole world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/12a5eda4d7373d798296a04d40232b18.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/12a5eda4d7373d798296a04d40232b18.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>Lead your army in tactical, grid-based battles with faster pacing, dynamic events and richer interaction. New skills, faction abilities and unit synergies deepen your strategical options along with the unique system of strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/f0c313ea7e36e0fe6ad60627e674ad93.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/f0c313ea7e36e0fe6ad60627e674ad93.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>Unlock and choose trusted companions to reflect your playstyle \u2013 leveraging their combat prowess and unique world skills to aid your quest to save Nevendaar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/d084fd44cd3704099aada8abc90a9953.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/d084fd44cd3704099aada8abc90a9953.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>Recruit and upgrade units from five distinct factions. Build powerful squads by combining unique skills and abilities and train them to defeat your enemies in turn-based encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/bc007e5bef45fddedece6141a1c0cf6d.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/bc007e5bef45fddedece6141a1c0cf6d.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>Travel the dark, living world of Nevendaar in real time. Uncover new regions, meet compelling characters, face terrifying foes, and dive into rewarding quests as the story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras/09ecf4cb5ef90675811a73171cb347c1.webp?t=1771843315\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/extras_big/09ecf4cb5ef90675811a73171cb347c1.webp?t=1771843315 width=1560 height=58 /></span>The dwarves are back \u2013 and they might not be your allies. Will they stand with you, or spark a new fire you\u2019ll be forced to extinguish?</p>","developers":["Artefacts Studio"],"dlc":[4107990,4107980],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808560/3ef3cead69aa958a72f1c4b5739b80303a437dbb/header.jpg?t=1771843315","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Disciples: Domination \u00a9 2026 Kalypso Media Group GmbH. Developed by Artefacts Studio. Published by Kalypso Media Group GmbH. Disciples is a trademark of Kalypso Media Group GmbH. All r